        "text": "Logged In: NO \n\nThis proposal coulde be extended in a way that the users \r\ncan &amp;quot;register&amp;quot; via publicly accessible form. Administrator \r\n\\(publisher\\) of the slice can then select user\\(s\\) and assign \r\naccess \\(author/editor\\) permissions to his/her slice. In \r\nthis way you will not need create the same user for each \r\ndifferent slice he/she should have access to.",
