  "created_date": "2002-03-23 12:24:05",
  "ticket_num": 3,
  "summary": "Publisher to add Users",
  "description": "Shouldn't we have a feature, that we can have some \r\nlike a group admin, who can add users in his group or \r\na publisher who can add usrs to his/her slice?\r\n\r\nAFAIK now every user has to be entered by the 'super \r\nadmin' which will most likely be the APC provider that \r\nruns the AA.\r\n\r\nIf we rent the AA to many clients, these should be \r\nable to add users to their own slices.\r\n\r\n\\--Udo\r\n",
