        "text": "Logged In: YES \nuser\\_id=53969\n\nThis is actually broken in a new way. All constants with \r\ncheckboxes are now forced onto a single line -- no wrapping \r\nat all -- stretching the screen mega-wide if there are many \r\nconstants defined.\r\n\r\nSimple fix:\r\n\r\n/include/formutil.php3\r\n\r\nLine 664: Add one space after the closing NOBR tag",
