  "discussion_thread_url": "https://sourceforge.net/rest/p/apc-aa/feature-requests/_discuss/thread/d9e1f996/",
  "created_date": "2002-12-17 18:52:21",
  "ticket_num": 17,
  "summary": "Advanced search module",
  "description": "An AA advanced search module would allow for more \r\nadvanced searching of materials in AA sites including:\r\n\r\n\\- Searching across many slices at once\r\n\\- User determined filtering of results by field, date etc.\r\n\\- Search result relevance rankings\r\n\\- Search full text of binary attachments \\(e.g. PDF\\)\r\n\r\nSome of the functions needed have recently been added \r\nthrough version 2.4 or through GreenNet's EIN project. \r\n\r\nOthers would need to be added from scratch. It is \r\npossible that these 'front scratch' components could be \r\nadded by pulling HTDig, Perlfect or anohter search \r\nenging into AA as a module. \r\n\r\nThe forms wizard currently under development could be \r\nused to create search pages. \r\n\r\nSponsorship: Depending on cost, these features could \r\nbe sponsored by the CEH and PKRN projects currently \r\nmanaged by Commons Group\r\n\r\nDeveloper: Marek has expressed an interest in working \r\non something like this. \r\n\r\nRequirements: Commons Group could work on detailed \r\nrequirements for this if needed. ",
  "reported_by": "msurman",
  "assigned_to": null,
